.TH MINTTWEAKS 1 "2026-10-21" "minttweaks 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
minttweaks \- maintenance, services and Samba management for Linux Mint
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B minttweaks
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B MintTweaks
is a GTK 3 application that gives Linux Mint one window for the system chores
that otherwise go through
.BR apt ,
.BR systemctl ,
.BR journalctl
and
.BR smb.conf .
.PP
It covers three areas: disk usage and cleanup, with a preview of what
.B apt-get
would remove and a careful removal of old kernels; systemd services with their
journals and a boot analysis; and complete Samba management, with share and
account administration, validation of the configuration by
.BR testparm ,
and automatic backups.
.PP
The application runs as the desktop user. The few actions that need
administrator rights are executed through
.BR pkexec (1),
so the usual polkit password dialog is used. No command is ever run through a
shell.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show a usage message and exit.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show the version and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-lang " CODE"
Force the interface language, for example \fB\-\-lang fr\fR. Without this
option the language comes from the usual
.BR locale (7)
environment variables.
.TP
.B \-\-dry-run
Print every command that would be run instead of running it. Also enabled by
setting \fBMTK_DRY_RUN=1\fR in the environment.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MTK_LOCALEDIR
Directory holding the compiled translation catalogues, in the usual
\fI<lang>/LC_MESSAGES/minttweaks.mo\fR layout.
.TP
.B MTK_ROOT_CMD
Replace the command used for privilege escalation (default:
.BR pkexec ).
Set it to an empty string to disable escalation entirely.
.TP
.B MTK_DRY_RUN
When set to \fB1\fR, no command is executed.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/samba/smb.conf
The Samba configuration edited by the Samba module.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/minttweaks/backups/
Timestamped copies of \fIsmb.conf\fR taken before every save.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/minttweaks/logs/minttweaks.log
Application log, rotated at 512 kB.
.TP
.I /var/backups/samba/
Last twenty copies kept by the privileged helper.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/minttweaks/mtk-root
The only program run as root; it installs \fIsmb.conf\fR after re-running
.BR testparm .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR apt-get (8),
.BR journalctl (1),
.BR pkexec (1),
.BR smb.conf (5),
.BR smbpasswd (8),
.BR systemctl (1),
.BR testparm (1)
